    "title": "32nd Annual Senior Citizens' Dinner returning to Vidalia this weekend - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tyler Walls ,\n9 hours ago VIDALIA, Ga. (WTOC) - A beloved community tradition honoring area elders is returning to Toombs County this weekend for its 32nd year. The 32nd Annual Senior Citizens’ Dinner will take place Saturday, Sept. 19, starting at 2 p.m. at the Vidalia Community Building, located at 107 Old Airport Road off Highway 280. Read full article",
